    "text": "theburn.com\nwebsite\nPurcellville\nVelocity Wings starts serving up buttermilk fried chicken\n11 hours ago\nWe have to issue an apology to our readers. The Burn prides itself on being Northern Virginia’s leading source for fried chicken news – and we dropped the ball. It turns out that the Velocity Wings restaurant chain added buttermilk fried chicken to its menu a few months back and we didn’t hear about it until today.\n2",
